]>
<suzuki><manual>
<section sectnbr = "4D">
<servcat sctnbr = "04" scnbr = "04">
<configtype typenbr = "0">
<servinfotype sitcode = "6">
<servinfo servinfosgmlid = "AENLSB0A4406004" svcinfotypenbr = "08" svcinfoqualnbr = "01" page = "2" supplyoff = "1" modify = "0">
<title>
Parking Brake Cable Removal and Installation
</title>
<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0A4406004001">
<title>
Removal
</title>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Place gear shift lever in “1st” (M/T model) or selector lever in “P” range (A/T model), and block drive wheels.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Disconnect parking brake cable from brake rear brake caliper. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A4306007"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove floor console box. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A9806020"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove the following parts.
</ptxt>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Exhaust center pipe
</ptxt>
</item>
<list2 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
K14C model: 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A1B16004"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
K14D model: 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A1B26004"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
</list2>
<item>
<ptxt>
Heat insulator
</ptxt>
</item>
<list2 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
K14C model: 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A1B16001"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
K14D model: 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A1B26001"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
</list2>
</list1>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Disconnect parking brake cable from vehicle. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A4406001"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
<attention3>
<ptxt>
If necessary to remove both right and left parking brake cables, repeat above steps.
</ptxt>
</attention3>
</servinfosub>
<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0A4406004002">
<title>
Installation
</title>
<ptxt>
Reverse removal procedure noting the following points.
</ptxt>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Tighten each bolt and nut to specified torque. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A4406001"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Check that parking brake cable end is installed to equalizer and lever securely.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Install E-ring (1) to hold parking brake cable (2) and then tighten parking brake cable clamp bolt (3).
</ptxt>
<attention4>
<ptxt>
Tightening parking brake cable clamp bolt before installing E-ring may cause brake dragging.
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
Tighten parking brake cable clamp bolt after installing E-ring.
</ptxt>
</attention4>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IGSB0A440004.jpg" width = "88.000mm" height = "66.791mm" ver = "01" gw = "199" gh = "173"/>
</figure>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Adjust parking brake cable. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A4406003"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
After completion of the installation and adjustment of parking brake lever stroke, check that brake system operates properly.
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</servinfosub>
</servinfo>
</servinfotype>
</configtype>
</servcat>
</section></manual></suzuki>
